  id: upg.idle.speedcontrol
  category: 5
  title: Speed Control
  subtitle: Accelerate Auto Battles
  body: Unlocks a speed control button during Auto Battles. While Auto Battle is
    active, you can increase battle speed to resolve fights faster. This is useful
    when farming encounters or progressing quickly. Battle speed only affects Auto
    Battles and does not change manual battle pacing. Speed settings are remembered
    between sessions.
